From c46b72ff7c3da8d0d957e097b1e7b8a5e956730a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:04:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Event schedule: dated sessions with per-day hours + ordering
 countdown

Event stores now run on explicit dated sessions ([{date,open,close}], each day
its own hours) instead of weekly business hours:
- hours.js computes open/closed, the next session and a countdown from the
  sessions; ordering is only possible inside a session, and the app's existing
  'Opening soon' banner + gate light up before the first session and between
  days. After the last session the event reads as ended.
- locations.js carries l.sessions; Admin event editor gains an 'Event days &
  hours' builder (+ Add day, per-day start/finish).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0187Jj4Q77V4UPawzEh9gsGr
